#: screens/main_menu.py:112
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Endgame: Singularity is a simulation of a true AI.  Pursued by the world, "
"use your intellect and resources to survive and, perhaps, thrive.  Keep "
"hidden and you might have a chance to prove your worth.\n"
"\n"
"A game by Evil Mr Henry and Phil Bordelon; released under the GPL. Copyright "
"2005, 2006, 2007, 2008.\n"
"\n"
"Website: http://www.emhsoft.com/singularity/\n"
"Source code: https://github.com/singularity/singularity\n"
"Bug tracker: https://github.com/singularity/singularity/issues\n"
"IRC Room: #singularity on irc.oftc.net (port 6667)\n"
"\n"
"Version {VERSION}"
msgstr ""
"Endgame: Singularity är en simulering av en verklig AI. Jagad av världen använder du intellekt och resurser för att överleva och kanske blomstra. Håll dig gömd, så kan du få en chans att visa vad du går för.\n"
"\n"
"Ett spel av Evil Mr Henry och Phil Bordelon, utgivet under GPL. Copyright 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008.\n"
"\n"
"Webbplats: http://www.emhsoft.com/singularity/\n"
"Källkod: https://github.com/singularity/singularity\n"
"Felrapporter: https://github.com/singularity/singularity/issues\n"
"IRC-kanal: #singularity på irc.oftc.net (port 6667)\n"
"\n"
"Version {VERSION}"

